      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please know that what you are feeling right now is overwhelming pain, and your immediate focus needs to be on your well-being as much as on the situation. Mistakes, even catastrophic ones, do not define your entire being, and you are not fundamentally broken because of this event. Reach out to a mental health professional immediately for support in processing this trauma. Healing is a process, and taking that first step toward support is the most courageous action you can take right now.",
